<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1.TheaboveResultshavebeenreviewed and recommended by Audit Committee and approved by Board at their respective Meetings on 17/05/2019. 2.During the year, Bhavnagar Energy Co Ltd �has been merged with GSECL vide a Scheme notified by GoG on 27/12/2018. GIPCL has been give 1 share of GSECL of Rs.10/- fully paid against its investment in BECL. As a consequence, the Company�s shareholding in BECL is extinguished and carrying value of investment in BECL of Rs.21808.00 Lakhs is recognized as loss in the value of investment and reflected as exceptional item. The Company is yet to receive the share from GSECL. 3. During previous financial year, the Board of Directors had approved the Voluntary Liquidation of GIPCO, a wholly owned subsidiary, under IBC Code, 2016. Pursuant to such approval, process of voluntary liquidation of GIPCO was initiated during the year and affairs of GIPCO were handed over to the Liquidator. The winding up of GIPCO by the Liquidator commenced on 3rd January 2019, the date of appointment of Liquidator and was closed as 20 March, 2019, as per their final report. The Company has received full and final liquidation distribution proceeds as against its investment. 4.Figures of the quarter ended 31st March 2019 and 31/03/2018 are the balancing figures between audited figures in respect of full FY and published year to the figures up to the third quarter ended 31/12/2018 and 31/12/2017 respectively. 5.The Company has only one reportable business segment viz."Power Generation". 6 Statutory Auditors have carried out an audit of the results for the year ended 31/03/ 2019 and have issued an unmodified opinion on the same. 7. Board of Directors have recommended payment of Dividend of Rs.2.90 per Equity Share (i.e.29% )for the financial year 2018-19. 8. Company has designated an exclusive e-mail ID viz.investors@gipcl.com for investor grievance redressal. </in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
